Nanum Gothic Coding is a font optimized for developers'
coding environments, based on Nanum Gothic font.It makes
development work more convenient for developers it
enhances readability in various editors and terminals for
source code editing, and minimizes unwanted coding errors
by clearly distinguishing easily confused characters such
as the uppercase I, lowercase l, the number 1,
the number 0, the uppercase O, and the lowercase o.

This contains the following font:

1. Nanum gothic coding
